   <media:title>Roadster | The Last Best Driver's Car</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/cvKIR-c1SsU?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/cvKIR-c1SsU/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Roadster is a true pilot's car: active aerodynamics, a multi-mode suction system &amp; cold-gas thrusters

Reserve Roadster - https://www.tesla.com/roadster

EXTERIOR:
– Concealed headlights, full-length taillight &amp; flush-mounted surfaces for a minimalist, highly technical form

– Super light wheels w/ thin spokes that reinforce structural strength when earthbound

– Ano White paint brings an aerospace-derived finish w/ UV &amp; cryogenic protection, electrostatic dissipation &amp; corrosion resistance

– Gold Glazed tinted glass mimicking the copper coating of spacesuit visors, w/ subtle titanium accents


INTERIOR:
– Ultrawhite interior w/ gray microsuede detailing &amp; seat bolsters for added grip

– Manual controls &amp; a fixed seat position reduce overall vehicle mass

– Lightweight, high-strength materials throughout, including magnesium, titanium &amp; carbon fiber help reduce it further

This allows Roadster to respond to driver inputs almost instantly


BEYOND THE LIMIT OF PHYSICS:
– Multi-mode fan &amp; ground sealing system pulls air from beneath the vehicle, generating enough suction to hold it upside down while stationary

– Powered fans &amp; active wings maximize traction and cornering speeds in all conditions, achieving massive downforce at zero speed

– Advanced cold-gas thrusters w/ all-electric actuators make micro adjustments within a fraction of a second to stabilize the vehicle in flight</media:description>
